{"product_id":"alchemy-of-desire","title":"Alchemy of Desire","description":"\u003cp\u003eAlternate cover for this ISBN can be found hereQuick-paced and inventive, brimming with ideas and memorable characters, \" The Alchemy of Desire\" celebrates the chaotic spirit of India at a time of great change. It also offers, in searing, lucid prose, a deeply sensual and moving account of the complex chemistry between sex, ambition and love. This is a major novel by one of the most significant new voices of his generation.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 133 x 203\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Tarun Tejpal\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780330435550\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 518\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45748945256601,"sku":"16RB-4-9780330435550","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68d62eb9be7bf_Alchemy_of_Desire_Tarun_Tejpal.jpg?v=1758895097","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/alchemy-of-desire","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}